{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1011703001:0":{"text":"What happened... The whole village is corrupted!","source_cn":"怎么会……整座村子都被腐化侵蚀了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05369EC352849598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011703002:0":{"text":"The soil reeks of decay, and even the nearby plants have wilted...","source_cn":"土壤浸透着腐臭的气味，就连周围的植被都枯死了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF864C35BB2EA8540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011703003:0":{"text":"Where are the villagers?! The Dusk Patrollers didn't receive any requests for help!","source_cn":"原来村里住的居民们呢？！薄暮巡游队没有接到任何求助的消息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4862C00BE4C307E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011703004:0":{"text":"Look at the mess and half-opened doors... The villagers must've fled in a hurry.","source_cn":"看此处屋门半敞，遍地狼藉。可能是在匆忙中逃离了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA6B24BBEED9FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1011703004":{"text":"Look at the mess and half-opened doors... The villagers must've fled in a hurry.","source_cn":"看此处屋门半敞，遍地狼藉。可能是在匆忙中逃离了……","status":